-- ************
-- *** NOTE *** THERE ARE NO WELD SIZES used in the TRUNNION DEFAULTS DATA COMPONENTS!
-- ************
--
-- Default WELD SIZE for MDS TRUNNION COMPONENTS ONLY
--
